# 🚀 Node.js Application Monitoring with Prometheus & Grafana

An end-to-end DevOps monitoring project that demonstrates how to deploy a containerized Node.js application on AWS EC2 and monitor application and infrastructure metrics using **Prometheus, Grafana, and Node Exporter**.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

This project implements a complete monitoring and observability stack on an AWS EC2 instance.

The Node.js application exposes application metrics through a `/metrics` endpoint. Prometheus collects these metrics, while Grafana visualizes the data through dashboards and provides alerting capabilities.

### 🏗️ Architecture

```text
                    AWS EC2 Instance
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                    │
│        Node.js Application                         │
│        Docker Container                            │
│        Port: 3000                                  │
│              │                                     │
│              │ /metrics                            │
│              ▼                                     │
│        Prometheus                                 │
│        Port: 9090                                  │
│              │                                     │
│              ▼                                     │
│        Grafana                                    │
│        Port: 3001                                  │
│                                                    │
│        Node Exporter                              │
│        Port: 9100                                  │
│        EC2 Host Metrics                            │
│                                                    │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

