# 🚨 Grafana Alerting

A Grafana alert rule was configured to monitor application availability.

### PromQL Query

```promql
up{job="nodejs-app"}
```

### Alert Condition

```text
up < 1
```

The alert detects when the Node.js application becomes unavailable.

## Alert Flow

```text
Application Running
        │
        ▼
   Alert Normal
        │
        │ docker stop monitorc
        ▼
 Application Down
        │
        ▼
     Pending
        │
        ▼
    Firing 🚨
        │
        │ docker start monitorc
        ▼
Application Running
        │
        ▼
   Alert Normal
```

---

