## Alert Firing When Application Is Down

The application container was stopped to simulate application downtime.

```bash
sudo docker stop monitorc
```

Grafana detected that the application was unavailable and triggered the configured alert.

![Grafana Alert Firing](./images/New%20panel%20-%20nodejs%20-%20nodejs%20monitoring%20-%20Alerting%20-%20Grafana%20-%20Google%20Chrome%2025-07-2026%2021_37_49.png)

---

## Alert Recovery

After restarting the application:

```bash
sudo docker start monitorc
```

The application returned to a healthy state and the Grafana alert returned to normal.

![Grafana Alert Recovery](./images/Screenshot%2025-07-2026%2021_37_16.png)

